@AIUsageGuard.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5172

### Register a workspace owner
POST {{AIUsageGuard.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "displayName": "Owner",
  "workspaceName": "Alpha Workspace"
}

### Submit an AI usage event
POST {{AIUsageGuard.Api_HostAddress}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "evt-001",
  "eventType": "prompt_submitted",
  "occurredAt": "2026-04-21T12:00:00Z",
  "toolName": "ChatGPT",
  "modelName": "gpt-5.4",
  "promptPreview": "hello"
}

### List AI usage events
GET {{AIUsageGuard.Api_HostAddress}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/events?pageNumber=1&pageSize=50
Accept: application/json

###
